          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 11.046,
          "end": 15.472,
          "text": "We were not elected in the lights so people can see that a bit better."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 18.886,
          "end": 20.784,
          "text": "Okay, that's fine."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 22.342,
          "end": 24.56,
          "text": "Am I supposed to be standing up there? Um"
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 0,
          "start": 25.126,
          "end": 27.088,
          "text": "So we've got both of these clipped on."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 0,
          "start": 29.222,
          "end": 32.944,
          "text": "gonna answer me yeah both of them okay"
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 80.614,
          "end": 81.136,
          "text": "Okay."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 81.926,
          "end": 94.864,
          "text": "Hello everybody, I'm Sarah, the project manager, and this is our first meeting, surprisingly enough. Okay, this is our agenda."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 95.814,
          "end": 115.932,
          "text": "We will do some stuff, get to know each other a bit better, to feel more comfortable with each other. Then we'll go do tool training, talk about the project plan, discuss our own ideas and everything. And we've got twenty-five minutes to do that, as far as I can understand."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 117.606,
          "end": 138.364,
          "text": "Now we're developing a remote control, which you probably already know. Um we want it to be original, something that s people haven't thought of, that's not out in the shops, um trendy, appealing to a wide market but you know, not a hunk of metal, and user friendly, grannies, tickets,"
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 138.438,
          "end": 141.936,
          "text": "Maybe even pooches should be able to use it."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 142.822,
          "end": 161.872,
          "text": "Okay. Um first is the functional design. Um this is where we all go off and do our individual work. Um what needs need to be fulfilled by the product, um what effect the product has to have and how it's actually going to do that. Um conceptual design"
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 162.31,
          "end": 168.944,
          "text": "what we're thinking, how it's going to go, and then the detailed design, how we're actually going to put it into practice and make it work."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 170.406,
          "end": 185.936,
          "text": "Okay, right. We're gonna practice with the pens and draw our favourite animal on the whiteboard, I'll go first, and sum up the characteristics of that animal. So"
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 188.87,
          "end": 193.264,
          "text": "Okay. I'll leave space for everyone else. Um"
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 243.238,
          "end": 244.848,
          "text": "We're running out of blue."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 246.918,
          "end": 251.344,
          "text": "Okay. I'm not going to ask you to guess, I'm going to tell you that it's supposed to be a tiger."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 254.502,
          "end": 257.872,
          "text": "And I see them as majestic."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 259.878,
          "end": 262.96,
          "text": "and independent."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 266.182,
          "end": 267.312,
          "text": "And"
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 268.742,
          "end": 269.744,
          "text": "proud."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 272.294,
          "end": 274.96,
          "text": "Now, who would like to go next?"
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 275.526,
          "end": 276.56,
          "text": "Okay."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 287.686,
          "end": 289.168,
          "text": "that you're la palm."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 289.638,
          "end": 290.736,
          "text": "There we go."
        }
      ],
